  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The goal of the project is to quantify the spatial and temporal variation in carbon, nutrients and suspended sediment fluxes along a thermal erosion gully of an Arctic ice wedge polygon terrace of Bylot Island, NU. As a result, daily sampling was conducted at 13 sites along a thermal erosion gully to investigate spatial and temporal variations of water chemistry and sediment."
